# Intake Shelf: Cold Storage, track 1 (SPEC 19.8). Along the ice shelf's
# edge with the open sea on the left (an open edge: off the road is into
# the water), on glare ice where the spray has frozen, down through a
# seawater intake pipe as wide as a tunnel and into the server halls under
# the snow (a grated walkway, glare ice up the halls' aisle, a steam vent
# where the warm outflow meets the ice), round the halls, back across a
# frozen inlet on thin sea ice (crust: the car behind goes through), and
# up the west side to the line.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has walls.
name INTAKE SHELF
order 1
floor snow
background shelf
league cold_storage
width 54
pit_band 8                         # the sea and the inlet are wide water
# x    y    half   features
 300  140   58                     # start line, heading east
 520  135   58     open:left drift,p=100   # the shelf's edge, the sea on the left; frozen spray
 740  145   56     open:left crates
 870  210   52
 905  350   48     pipe            # the intake pipe, straight down
 905  600   50
 880  780   52
 760  880   52     shadow,len=36   # into the halls: the grated walkway
 630  860   48
 590  720   48     drift,p=100     # glare ice up the halls' aisle
 590  540   46     vent:left,period=300,warn=50 drift,p=100   # warm outflow meets the ice
 540  380   46
 420  330   46
 320  400   46
 320  620   48
 300  790   52     crates
 210  890   54
 115  820   54
 110  640   50
 115  480   50     open crust,lo=-16,hi=16   # across the frozen inlet: thin sea ice mid-channel
 130  330   52
 180  210   54
# The open sea along the top of the map, beyond the shelf's edge.
furrow 52 -60 22 1090 22
# Props: turbines on the shelf by the sea road, radar domes and a crane by
# the intake, pylons along the halls, the colony sign (and its last
# penguin) by the inlet.
props turbine seg 1 side right gap 80 off 26
props radar,turbine seg 3 side left gap 70 off 26
props pipe seg 4 side both gap 120 off 22
props crane,radar seg 8 side right gap 80 off 24
props pylon seg 14 side left gap 70 off 22
props turbine,radar seg 20 side right gap 90 off 26
prop sign 220 470
prop penguin 214 560
